--- a/TESTNET.md
+++ b/TESTNET.md
@@ -41,6 +41,20 @@ peer address clones should dial. The seed dials its sibling seeds
   (2026-08-24) — endpoint, rate-limit store, and `KOVANICA_TAP` are gone.
 - Wallet `prepare` / `submit` stays open: you sign in the browser; the node never sees the seed.
 
+## Metrics
+
+RFC-006 supply is scraped as Prometheus gauges (updated on every accepted
+block, mined or received) alongside `GET /api/head`'s `subsidy` /
+`native_minted` / `total` / `circulating` / `burned` / `max_supply` fields:
+
+| Metric | Meaning |
+| --- | --- |
+| `kovanica_supply_total` | Total KVNC issued so far (atoms) |
+| `kovanica_supply_circulating` | Issued minus locked/immature (atoms) |
+| `kovanica_supply_burned` | Cumulative burned (atoms) |
+| `kovanica_supply_max` | RFC-006 hard cap (atoms) |
+| `kovanica_supply_subsidy` | Current block subsidy (atoms) |
+
 ## Run
 
 See [README.md](./README.md).
